\newlabel{fig:flow_loss}{{3.9}{43}{Training and validation loss of the flow-matching U-Net (Eq.~\ref {eq:flow_loss}; 5-epoch rolling mean).Validation is best at epoch 109 (\mbox {$0.145$}) and drifts upward afterwards while training continues to fall; the best-validation checkpoint is used for all evaluation}{figure.3.9}{}}
